<li>Read the database connection string from an environment variable.</li>
<li>In your local development environment, set this variable to <code>postgres://neon:npg@localhost:5432/&lt;database_name&gt;</code>.</li>
<li>In production, set it to your real Neon connection string.</li>
<li>You may need to conditionally disable SSL for the local connection.</li>
</ol><p>No other code modifications are necessary.</p></div></div>
