<p>You&#x27;ve now learned how to integrate Neon local and Neon Local Connect into your workflow. With Neon Local Connect, you get a full-featured database IDE that makes managing branches as easy as managing Git branches. For more advanced or automated setups, Neon Local with Docker provides the same powerful capabilities for any environment, ensuring you always have clean, isolated, and production-like databases for development and testing.</p>
